# Power BI Semantic Model — Technical Documentation

## 1. Purpose and scope

This semantic model brings together data from sales, inventory, campaigns, promotions, order processing, and revenue targets. Its purpose is to allow business users to analyse related processes through shared descriptive dimensions while preserving the appropriate grain of each fact table.

**Evidence basis:** This document describes the table names, fields, and visible relationship structure shown in Power BI screenshots. Where an exact key, setting, DAX expression, or security configuration cannot be verified from those images, it is marked **To verify** rather than assumed.

